# Zaod OS base system packages, Debian trixie.
#
# Grouped by purpose. Everything here is required for the supported desktop or
# for the system to boot; nothing is pulled in "for convenience". Packages that
# only exist for the Debian package manager are deliberately absent from the
# install set and removed in the final stage instead (see rootfs.remove.list),
# because the desktop packages depend on a few of their libraries.

